Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:18:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 009/371] client: island preload + no requests import (were
 only in the installed client, 09-16/09-18)

IslandPreload loads every island model on the loader thread while the pirate
chooser is up. ClientServicesManager drops 'from requests import get' (the
Panda3D python on the family PCs has no requests; its only caller is commented out).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
