 pirates/uberdog/ClientServicesManager.py      |   2 +-
 pirates/world/IslandPreload.py                |  29 ++
 pirates/world/IslandPreload.txt               | 474 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 506 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 pirates/world/IslandPreload.py
 create mode 100644 pirates/world/IslandPreload.txt

